---
description: JB steering rules (mirror of CLAUDE.md)
alwaysApply: true
---
Storage goes through app/store.py::Store; MemoryStore by default, MongoStore (pymongo, because the protocol is synchronous) when MONGODB_URI is set, swapped in app/deps.py. Indexes and seed documents live in migrations/ and are applied by migrate.py, never at startup. app/identity.py normalizes X-Demo-User into the engine's user id; Auth0 is not wired and nothing branches on provider outside that module. All model calls go through app/llm.py. /agent/chat returns one JSON message, never a stream. packages/contracts/types.ts is hand authored; gen_contract.sh only exports openapi.yaml. Run one uvicorn worker.

Read Plan.md sections 7 and 8 and docs/DECISIONS.md before changing any schema, route, shared type, or db collection. Pull before you start. Respect directory ownership (A frontend + apps/imessage, B discovery, C market, D agents/deploy/docs). Contract changes need a DECISIONS.md entry, regenerated openapi.yaml and types.ts, and a commit prefixed "contract:". Grok and K2 are called from the app only, never used to write code. No em dashes in docs or UI copy.
